  <h1>About RainXLife</h1>
  <p>RainXLife exists to make the best ideas from books easier to find, understand, and actually use. We read the books, pull out the ideas that matter most, and explain them in plain language — with original examples and practical steps you can apply the same day.</p>
  <p>Every summary is an original interpretation, written to help you decide whether a book is worth your time and to give you a head start on its core ideas. We always credit the original author and book, and we encourage readers who want the full depth and nuance to read the complete book.</p>
  <p>RainXLife started as a set of short videos on TikTok. This website is where the written, more detailed version of those ideas lives.</p>
